# KonSol 0.5 / KAP2 interactive counter
KAP2

CLS BLACK
TEXT 16 20 3 CYAN "TOUCH COUNTER"
TEXT 16 52 2 YELLOW "TAP SCREEN 5X"
SERIAL "COUNTER KAP2"

MOVI R0 0
MARK LOOP

WAIT_TOUCH
INC R0
GET_TOUCH_X R1
GET_TOUCH_Y R2

CLS BLACK
TEXT 16 18 3 CYAN "TOUCH COUNTER"
TEXT 20 72 2 WHITE "TAPS"
DRAW_REG 120 72 3 YELLOW R0
TEXT 20 112 2 WHITE "X"
DRAW_REG 80 112 2 CYAN R1
TEXT 20 142 2 WHITE "Y"
DRAW_REG 80 142 2 CYAN R2

CMPI R0 5
JNZ LOOP

TEXT 20 178 2 GREEN "DONE"
TEXT 20 204 2 YELLOW "TOUCH TO EXIT"
WAIT_TOUCH
EXIT
